WEBVTT

00:09:57.968 --> 00:10:00.220
"You will leave a legacy around ..."

00:10:02.306 --> 00:10:05.184
Bottom line, you can't do this wrong.

00:10:05.225 --> 00:10:06.518
It's impossible.

00:10:06.977 --> 00:10:09.063
And if writing’s not your thing,

00:10:09.063 --> 00:10:11.023
what if you made a video?

00:10:11.523 --> 00:10:12.691
A drawing?

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.028
Maybe you're really good
at PowerPoint decks.

00:10:17.112 --> 00:10:19.365
Could you write a grace sentence?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.786
The medium doesn't matter.

00:10:24.161 --> 00:10:25.913
What matters is the doing.

00:10:28.123 --> 00:10:31.168
What I've learned
in this journey of my own